        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "No, this is not a joke. You\u2019re bullying your friend. Do you
          know what bullying is? Is when you are intentionally hurting someone with
          words and actions and you do it over and over and over. You know what can
          happen to a person who is bullied? You hurt them in many ways, they can
          become depressed, they can also attempt self-harm, you destroy their self-esteem!
          You DO NOT bully people. EVER!"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
